# SQL Data Analysis Projects

This section showcases practical SQL projects focused on data exploration, data transformation, business analysis, and insight generation using structured datasets.

## Projects

### 1. Swiggy Food Delivery Analysis

A SQL-based food delivery analytics project focused on analyzing restaurant performance, customer behavior, order patterns, pricing, ratings, and delivery-related metrics.

The project demonstrates the use of SQL to transform raw data into meaningful business insights and support data-driven decision-making.
